Personal website for Benjamin Getraer

Contents:
README		this file
build.sh		bash script for compiling src to docs
src/			source code and data
	templates/layout.html	shared layout of each page
	pages/						content for each web page to be made
	fonts/						font files
	css/							style files
	data/							json and other data files
docs/			published webpages and directories of supporting files

Overview:
Each website page follows the structure of templates/layout.html, which contains environmental variables for content which varies by page. The build.sh script loops through each file in src/pages, and outputs a page to docs/ with the layout populated by the appropriate content.

To publish to local server:
$ ./build.sh
$ python3 -m http.server 8000
Open http://localhost:8000/index.html in browser
